Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.78,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DUE TO POOR COMMUNICATION SKILLS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:08.04,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HOW DIFFICULT LIFE BECOMES,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I WILL SHARE A CASE WITH YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:14.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I AM DR. HEMA PRASAD, PSYCHOLOGIST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:18.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,IN THE CASES I DEALT WITH RECENTLY,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:20.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,A BOY HAD COMMUNICATION...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.38,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE STUDIES VERY WELL,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.94,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,GETS GOOD MARKS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.14,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVERYTHING IS VERY GOOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.52,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ON PAPER, HE IS VERY GOOD, EXCELLENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.82,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT WHEN MADE TO SIT AND SPEAK,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.14,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARS ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:35.18,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARS TALKING TO THE PERSON OPPOSITE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:37.58,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,TO GO AND TAKE COACHING ANYWHERE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:39.46,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE IS AFRAID TO GO TO COACHING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:42.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WITH SO MANY FEARS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:44.48,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE COULDN'T FACE INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:46.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,GOING TO INTERVIEWS, FAILING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:48.64,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,GOING TO INTERVIEWS, FAILING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:50.48,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY IS ALL THIS HAPPENING?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:52.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MAINLY, NOWADAYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.44,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,THERE IS NO NEED TO FEAR ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:58.74,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE EVERY SUBJECT YOU STUDY IS IN ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:00.78,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVEN SO, WHY DOES THAT BOY FEAR?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:04.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE HE LOOKS AT AN INTERVIEW UNDER A MAGNIFYING GLASS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:08.64,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,FROM CHILDHOOD, TO SPEAK TO ANYONE...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:11.86,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY DOES THIS HAPPEN? THE SUBJECT WITH YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:14.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,IS THEORETICAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:17.20,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU DON'T KNOW THE WAY TO EXPLAIN IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:20.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MEANING, THE SUBJECT IS INSIDE YOU,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU CAN TELL IT, BUT CANNOT EXPRESS IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:26.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE HE COULDN'T EXPRESS IT LIKE THAT,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.70,0:01:28.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVEN THOUGH HE HAS ALL THE ANSWERS,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:32.40,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,SADLY, HE IS FAILING MANY INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.44,0:01:34.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I WILL TELL YOU HOW TO PRACTICE FOR THIS.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.56,0:00:48.64,PunchCallout,,0,0,0,,{\c&H002020FF&}GOING {\c&H0000E6FF&}INTERVIEWS
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.70,0:01:30.90,PunchCallout,,0,0,0,,{\c&H002020FF&}SADLY {\c&H0000E6FF&}FAILING
